{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15d5_level_act15d5_st06",
  "groupId": "act15d5",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "劍與天秤",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st06.txt",
  "sourceHash": "54b012ff1f004a22739b0d1f0c42c260bed65605cf36a6c7f1f9535902d0d3e7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "到此為止。別再逃了，警察很快就會追到這裡，已經太遲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，你也是他們派來的追兵？說什麼羅德島的任務，什麼有醫生願意治感染者也全是騙人的，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老湯姆警告過我們，別相信那些外來的人。哈，我沒聽他的，我覺得你夠義氣，和那些有幾個錢就斜眼看人的蠢貨不一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "結果就是這樣。我才是那個蠢貨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......隨你怎麼想。不管你相不相信，我都要說，我和外面的那些警察沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你就放我離開這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "抱歉，這我做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你在去警局的路上突然發難，打傷了兩名看守又連夜逃出城，這種情況下，我不能就這麼放你走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "現在有三支小隊在搜捕你，我只是恰好先他們一步。只要踏出這裡，你就會被其他人發現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那麼多人裡，只有我知道你沒做過他們控告裡寫的那些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——我當然沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那幫混蛋要抓我，就因為我和那個死在街頭的外國佬多說了一句話！就這一句話，他們就控告我殺了人，可不可笑啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“現場殘留有法術痕跡，經推斷或為感染者作案”......我呸！我要真有那個本事，他們還有命在？我有什麼本事啊？我連把火都放不出！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "在光天化日下殺掉一個武裝過的雇傭兵，你沒這個能耐。這是我還站在這裡和你說話的唯一理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我信你沒殺人。但你襲警傷人，拒捕逃竄，這些罪名都是逃不掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "別再抵抗了，這對你沒有好處。哥倫比亞比我見過的很多地方都好上許多，我看過法院的審判，你們有陪審團，還有民眾可以旁聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你有可以為自己辯白的場所。你可以把一切告訴所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "儘管有限，但這裡的感染者至少有公正......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "阿米婭，聽說哥倫比亞是個法制十分健全的地方，那裡有法官，有關押感染者的監獄，我想去親眼看一看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "當然可以。陳長官想去哪裡都可以，不如說，我也更希望陳長官能夠多去各種地方看一看呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊......是不是不該叫長官了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳小姐。哎？不需要這麼尊敬？可是......好，好的，那，陳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不行，總覺得有點不好意思......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "咳咳，言歸正傳。我對哥倫比亞並沒有太多瞭解，在法制和刑事這方面，陳小姐也一定比我要知道得多，所以對這些，我就不多說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "只是，我卻很清楚一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "人與人之間的相互輕賤與敵視，可以發生在任何地點，任何場合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "它可以發生在健康的人和感染者之間，也可以發生在富有的人和貧窮的人之間，甚至是一些被人為劃分出的界限......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "總有人會將同胞割裂，分出高低，分出貴賤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "請不要急著否認，陳小姐。我聽說過哥倫比亞有很多感染者，他們能去拓荒，能賺到錢，有一些甚至能得到公民身份......這生活聽起來很有希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但是，陳小姐，好不好是需要親自去看，去判斷的。烏薩斯的土地是直白的殘酷，而許多地方，只是將這份殘酷遮掩在了乾淨的餐布下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我從來沒有忘記過，在指揮塔的那天，陳小姐說過的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "公平地對待所有人，公平地審判所有人......那很美好，也會很難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "因為從來沒人走過那條路，所以就連方向也沒有，只能靠陳小姐，靠我們自己，一步一步去踏出一條路來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......我有些擔心陳小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我很怕你會失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼狗屁公正？！你這是在做夢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰會聽我辯白？難道有哪一個被押上法庭的“罪犯”，沒有為自己痛哭流涕，沒有說自己是清白無辜的嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但他們把你捉到那一圈木頭欄杆裡，就像捉隻羽獸關進籠子，然後掐著脖子把你的肚子剖開，給別人看裡頭是不是生著一副黑心腸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道那些陪審老爺裡有多少人會花錢請人來演講，就在街上說“染病的窮光蛋在佔領城市，在掏空我們的錢袋”？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道什麼，你才來多久，你什麼都不知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不。不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "或許我還沒來得及更多地瞭解這裡，但我瞭解一個國家的暴力機構。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我曾經對這些感到失望所以離開。我知道其中麻木甚至腐壞的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "但相比那些，我更清楚如果這股力量不再能穩定這個社會，如果人人都能挑戰被暴力所保障的秩序，接下來會發生多可怕的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "所以......我不能放你就這麼逃出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "至少不是在這個滿城人都知道有罪犯襲擊警察，並且逃走的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不打算放我走。我打不過你，行，我認栽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我不會感到抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不論今天站在你這個位置的是其他任何什麼人，我都會這麼選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "這不是玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......但如果事實真是你說的那樣，如果他們真的讓你背上冤罪，我也會採取行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我希望事情不會真的走到那一步......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道的就是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是個感染者，你沒有錢，就只配這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來這的感染者要嘛在鐵盒子裡發爛發臭，要嘛去荒原上拿命去拼，還有力氣的人都去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小皮爾，湯姆，傻大個馬爾斯，小子們一批一批地去，他們沒一個再回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還記得老湯姆嗎？總是說你壞話的那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "怎麼不記得。我來你們那條街的第一天，他就想騙走我戴著的手鏈，反被我教訓了一頓也不老實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他記仇，我們當時都以為你招惹了這個老東西，肯定沒法在這條街待下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "顯然我比你們想的要更不好惹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。早就沒人敢惹你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你收拾老湯姆，也沒下重手，讓他皮緊一陣子也是好事，所以沒人管過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家都知道他不是個好東西，偷摸搶騙，他都幹過。為了給他那個孫女弄一條裙子，配一串首飾，他什麼都做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圖什麼呢，他那個漂亮孫女收了他的錢和東西，轉頭在城裡和有錢人好上，有了房子，再也不許老頭的泥腳踩她家的地磚。哈，他圖什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......我就該第一個把他送進警局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得了，我問你，你有多久沒見過他了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "兩周。也有可能更長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "等等，你為什麼突然提起這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——他怎麼了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "阿米婭，如果我努力到生命終結，也始終看不到有那樣一個地方，那樣一個讓所有人公正地接受審判的地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那麼那些在不公的土壤上成長，又確實犯了錯的人，我該怎麼對待他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "羅德島可以一時地關押這樣的人，可最終他們會走向什麼方向？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我可以懲惡，我可以揚善，我可以阻止不公正的私刑，我擁有能做到這件事的能力。我可以為了我想要的正義放下許多別的東西，我願意為之奔走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "但我會問自己，我到底有沒有權利去做這樣一件事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "誰有權力去定另一個人的罪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米婭不在這裡，我來替阿米婭回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米婭一定會說，“沒人能審判他人”。凱爾希醫生老是這樣說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她們都是好人，很好的人。她們不會騙我，我信她們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我......我認識另一群很好的大個子，我們並肩戰鬥，我們一起打退了壞人，他們相信我，我也信他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我覺得他們說的是對的。如果你面對的是壞人，他做了壞事，你能看出來，那你就說他有罪。有罪的人就應該被懲罰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陳在煩惱的是什麼呢？沒關係的，陳現在也變成我的家人了，家人是該互相幫助的。所以，如果陳下不了手，那就我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會阻止不公。我能阻止有人要別人失去家人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果罪不該死，卻有人要他死，我就阻止。我阻止要殺人的人，然後懲罰壞蛋。做了什麼錯事，就怎麼懲罰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果偷盜，就得挨揍。如果傷人，就切掉傷人的那隻手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣好嗎？這樣不就可以了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會努力長大，我會努力拿到能裁量的那把尺子。我會看出人的好壞。我會審判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你說什麼——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你剛剛說什麼，你再說一遍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說——人死啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早死了！得罪了不該得罪的人，被拖在地上抓進去，又不肯交點錢，開口之前就能被搗好幾拳，那老東西一把年紀了，能活幾天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "他們這樣用私刑就沒人管？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰管你？老湯姆那樣的人，誰為他說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老東西想看一眼孫女，臨死也沒看著。他孫女早就不和他聯繫了，他摸騙一點錢，全寄過去，半點回音也沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我告訴你，他們不找你麻煩，只是因為你還有用，你能賺到錢，就還有點價值！但我們不能被抓到一丁點錯誤，否則就得要被剝下一層皮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道殺人不是大罪嗎？但我告訴你，從來沒人會因為死一個得病的窮光蛋而去為難另一個體面人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果有人要你的命，那碾死一個人就和彈掉一粒灰塵一樣簡單。他們有的是理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你聽到外頭的聲音了沒？他們追來了，我也沒好下場，我也活不了了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不會的。我知道你沒有殺人，如果你受到不公平的判罰，我不會坐視不理，我會幫你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "漂亮話！都這樣了，你能怎麼幫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_094",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在堵著我活路的難道不是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我會找到辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "相信我。一定不會送你去死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "沒有任何人該被加上不符合重量的責罰。如果有人認為這理所當然，那他就錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "就從我眼前開始，我會去糾正這種錯誤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......這是我現在唯一能做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我一直在想，該怎麼去做這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "最開始，我總覺得羅德島的理念天真又幼稚，不是不好，但要實現很難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "現在回頭再看，就發現其實我和你們實在沒什麼分別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "阿米婭，你說沒人能給我指路。我想你是對的，我很早就看清這一點，我對此早有準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "可......如果到頭來，我所能依仗的還是只有一身力氣，一腔熱情，一把劍，那我能改變的，是不是也只有劍鋒能觸及的這片範圍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "魏彥吾曾經教我，落子無悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不管是去核心城，還是離開龍門......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我都沒有後悔過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "或許魏彥吾替我安排的，的確是所能設想的最好的那條路。但我不想那樣去選，我沒法坦然身處那個位置，那對我來說是種煎熬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我心不安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "有人用行動告訴她，或許有些理想，就是窮盡一生也無法實現。可儘管明知無法實現，卻依然還是要去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "她是對的。她也這樣做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我也一樣會去做我要做的事。我說過，這不是我的理想，而是我的工作。這是我有責任去做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "自那件事後，我總在想該怎麼做。我還沒有答案，我只能做我能做的。但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我感到慶幸。在這條路上，還有羅德島和我一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們任務完成得真快......這還不到一周吧，就都解決了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "合約上有時間限制，必須要速戰速決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真厲害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是各位的任務表，每人一份，請小心收好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......對了，我們小隊臨時來了一個新人，申請表在這，麻煩幫他也開一個證明吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦？加人了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "是臨時決定的，還沒來得及通知。抱歉，是我的失職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事沒事，那稍等一下哦。我得回去再拿一份表格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，能幫我轉告阿米婭一個好消息嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上次推廣的預防藥反應不錯，如果能繼續維持低價的話，應該就能把現在打開的這塊市場給穩定下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果順利，下一步就可以擴大銷售點了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "的確是好消息。阿米婭會高興的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "目前的銷售體量要再擴大的話，就需要羅德島直接運輸藥品過來......唔，我會儘快通知到阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，那太好了，我有好久沒見過阿米婭了呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你和阿米婭......很熟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還不錯，我是學醫的，之前都在船上實習，後來因為實在想家，和凱爾希醫生談過之後，就回來這裡辦事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也挺好的。再存點錢，我就能和朋友合夥開間診所了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "祝你順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝，各位幹員如果在任務途中受傷，也可以找我幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那沒事我就先回去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "好。我送你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎不用，不用，我這沒什麼事。陳小姐才是，路上千萬要小心些！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近剛發生殺人案呢，怪嚇人的......不過陳小姐聽說沒，這個案子還有個挺有意思的後續。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家都在討論這事，據說原本有個收治區的倒楣蛋被抓了，結果沒兩天兇手居然主動去警局自首，那人就又被放出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，我可不信這套。事情根本就不是這麼回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，這事我偷偷告訴陳小姐，可千萬不要說給別人聽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "好，我一定保密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有個親戚就在警局工作，所以我知道點內幕，聽他說那殺人犯根本不是自首，而是被一個神秘人綁起來連同證據一起扔在警局門口的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這年頭居然還有這種事，你說奇不奇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "哈哈，確實離奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對吧！那些媒體還有說要給這個神秘人起個名字的呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亦正亦邪的高手！游離在系統之外的制裁者！懲惡揚善主持公道的英雄！說什麼的都有，聽起來有夠酷的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "酷嗎？我不這麼認為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "如果本地的警察沒有抓錯人，本來也就不需要這樣的人來出風頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我倒希望，之後不要再給這個神秘人出現的機會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼說那倒也是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙著臉的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "東西都準備好了，該走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你的東西真的都不用取了？雖然未必能全都帶上，但好歹能拿一些留個紀念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙著臉的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙著臉的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我在這裡沒有太多需要紀念的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙著臉的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "或許從頭開始會更好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那我們走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "阿米婭，我知道我一定會遭受種種挫折，我一定會對很多東西失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "但我也知道，我不會停下，我絕不會放棄走下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
